The [[Sacred Griffon of Amnoon]] is a [[Griffon]] that was once worshiped by one of the people living in the [[Crystal Desert]] before their demise. It must be slain in order to show that one is not intimidated by the so-called sacred and are therefore suitable to become a [[Necromancer]].

